    "description": "Explore endless creations in Magic Merge: Endless Craft\r\nMix elements to craft the world from scratch! Unleash your creativity and discover fantastical creatures, from griffins to vampires! \u200d\u2640\ufe0f  Play now!\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udfae How to play:\r\nDrag and drop elements to combine them.\r\nDiscover new items with surprising combinations.\r\nLearn about your creations in the in-game encyclopedia.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udcbb Game Features:\r\nGinormous Libary: Combine numerous elements to create a vast library of unique items.\r\nVisually stunning: Immerse yourself in a vibrant new art style that brings your creations to life.\r\nCharming soundtrack: Relax and unwind to a delightful original soundtrack.",
